Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.62,Alternative,,0,0,0,,I'm being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:19.52,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:21.90,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, all crew to battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.99,0:05:26.82,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Scramble. Fighters, prepare to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:29.24,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Catapult crew, prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:32.20,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat, catapult crew, prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.55,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Iscandarians had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirenel sacrificed herself to tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are now the last of the Jirels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life, Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I am the last, I shall remain loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Loyal, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So you ran, unable to deal with a single, native rebellion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.51,0:02:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They surrounded the capital. There was nothing we could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Director-General Gimleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please use this fleet to protect the refugees that couldn't evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us burn this planet to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A planet that rebels against the Leader and the Empire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,must not be allowed to exist in Great Garmillas territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That also goes for you, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That joke isn't funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I dislike jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, play the melody of destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the recoil brake for the gravity anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure it's fastened securely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you doing here at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.13,0:04:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.34,0:04:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird, isn't it? Just leave it to the mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the craft I'm piloting for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have an attachment to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the way this looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll show you I can pilot a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We left the Milky Way, but we're\Nencountering the enemy more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get to{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So please take the time to teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of things. But I guess you wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Two enemy cruisers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,More force reconnaissance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, stand by at battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.22,0:05:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance is 9,000. Speed unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance is now 8,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy's turning around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They keep calling us to battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never get a chance to rest if we{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can understand her being upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.79,0:06:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She has stuff going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It will take time to get the OMCS back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find food and water, or our stores may run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are barely any systems in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.93,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The map Iscandar sent us says that a system lies four light years ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Its name is Beemela.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Beemela...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Observation suggests the system's\Nfourth planet is likely an Earth-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been on this tiny ship for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of the crew are suffering from heavy stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it would be good for us to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigator Shima, your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.79,0:07:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't cause a problem with the schedule?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.31,0:07:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go nuts if we keep having to eat this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really feel like I've gotten any sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Iscandar actually exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about a pretty girl's ghost that people keep seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayashi, from navigation, saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And they say that this ghost may be an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You look tired, so I was checking if you have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't enough food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The OMCS is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:07:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, it'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Food quality directly affects morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Misaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't been running your radio lately... What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Wave Motion Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,based on a specific solution of the Buchinsky Wave Motion formula?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This solution allows us to release part\Nof a miniaturized Calabi-Yau manifold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the released energy proportional to\Nthe space-time supersymmetry moduli?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't directly correlated to the supersymmetry moduli.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:09:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At its core, it's a miniaturized superstring landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that cause the superstring vacuum to dissipate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The universe would be torn apart...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuria... Let's go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The collapse of a Euclidean two-dimensional black hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I never realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Yuria's new hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She changed her hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain... I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun... That weapon of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.12,0:09:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Leader is coming here, to Balun, for an inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.09,0:09:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Ditz says that he's coming in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we should prepare a reception!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If we wish to demonstrate our loyalty, we must first defeat the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.47,0:10:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Our force recon has probably exhausted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Our recon battalion says that the Yamato has set course for the Beemela system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.79,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And this neutron star, Carell 163, lies between them and Beemela.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If they jump, Carell 163's gravity well will interfere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,causing them to Geschtam out at one of these five points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We will attack then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy fleets at these five locations, and as soon as you see the Yamato, gather...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...and destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Running is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think of the rebels as people. They are fleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If they resist, kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them run in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This house is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships are ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Joint Staff Operations, Division 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.76,0:12:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was where they proposed the Yamato Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Joined the department on September 7th, '98.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Hijikata recommended her for the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hijikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,For the past year, since her parents died, Hijikata has been her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.73,0:12:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father was Undersecretary for Foreign Affairs, Naoyuki Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hijikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can easily imagine him doing it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Altering her records.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Professional intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.88,0:12:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so interested in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a crush?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.63,0:12:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next stop looks quite promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a word of advice... Stay away from the XO.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, I'd like some insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me. I know where to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayashi? I've got that data input...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.04,0:13:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.88,0:13:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the schedule looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we on track?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. We're making good progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This voyage's success depends on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the most important person on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.46,0:13:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.21,0:14:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,May I have a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Linking with system satellites. Opening Geschtam Gates to Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.97,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty gek until Gate opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Leader, our ship is now entering the Geschtam Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Balun lies just beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem in main engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure is rising. At this rate, it will over-boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stabilize it! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.58,0:14:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Leader is missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, Ditz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you the only one who knew this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Leader's whims are nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The marshal seems dissatisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:15:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rather pleased, after putting down the rebellion on Alteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not put it down. I annihilated the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Guard goes too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot maintain peace in the Empire without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.37,0:15:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that rebellions have cropped up everywhere since the Yamato appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But this just makes it worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pure bloods are the only ones who matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.71,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot trust the barbarians who do not have blue skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, this is no time for talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Leader's Deusura has exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Desler has been assassinated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from scout ship. They have sighted the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the scouts provoke the Yamato. Force them into jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No obstacles in our warp path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Effects from the neutron star?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Our course will be affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, prepare for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship on our radar. Two enemy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Approaching from our rear. Enemy speed is seven s-knots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,More force recon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to our port side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, go to warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.06,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Without sufficient supplies, it would be folly to engage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, the neutron star will affect our warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to compensate, then go to warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutron star is at ten o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So it did affect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships on our radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy fleet off our bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Our rear, as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiple ships surrounding us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where the Yamato ended up emerging!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Right into our trap! Order all ships to rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.76,0:17:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to launch the Hayabusas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd be hit while trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy Wave Motion Shield at maximum.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge them at combat speed 2. We'll break through!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.35,0:17:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.58,0:17:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Super-Dreadnought class ship in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never make it through without taking risks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack on our keel's shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Open torpedo tubes on bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Shield's deflection ability is decreasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep taking hits, they'll penetrate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll strike their center. Concentrate fire to our front.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.59,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,1604 has been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Have them withdraw and switch position with the ship behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Shield is at critical point. Shield is dissipating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato has broken through our front ships. It's approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is a fierce opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:19:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Domel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Open all gunports! Destroy the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine Room! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunport 1 is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Radar is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Switch to inertial navigation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only after one ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going, and ram it if you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold position! The Domelaze does not retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.46,0:21:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Engines to full!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's our prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay quiet, fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Second squad is in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.69,0:21:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Squadron 3, strike from right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.96,0:22:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Domel, a message from the home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a class-one priority message from the Leader's Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Leader's Office?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.76,0:22:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondary gunport 2, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.89,0:22:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine output is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.31,0:22:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondary gunport 2, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedoes! What are you doing? Lay down some fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.36,0:22:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An order to return home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Deputy Lord Hyss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost have the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.65,0:22:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw the fleet, and return to the home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.58,0:22:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a top-priority order. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunport 3, keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Are we going to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.72,0:23:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships are warping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All enemy ships have warped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.45,0:23:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They were this close... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato weighs anchor and rests its wounded body,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.63,0:25:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,upon an Earth-like planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a place longed-for by those who will soon be extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A conspiracy raises its head,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.91,0:26:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and we are asked what path we should take.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.35,0:26:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: A Choice for the Future.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 287 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:24.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No matter how steep or far the road is
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.19,0:24:28.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will not give up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.66,0:24:37.33,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Endless tears flowing down my cheek are not
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:42.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}A white flag of surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.63,0:24:54.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}I go and become the wings of a loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:58.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}Gather up the shattered dream
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:04.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And take it to the end of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:07.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:09.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Row strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:16.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And hold your thoughts close to your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:20.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.42,0:25:24.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Through your despair
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.25,0:25:32.51,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}A ray of light shines
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:59.38,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1399.5,840)}Episode 15{\fad(2000,1600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:59.38,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(1331.5,1073)}Point of No Return{\fad(2000,1600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:09.44,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)}{\fad(0,500)}Planet Alteria {\fscx75}—{\fscx100} Nord Greater Province
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.62,tsing 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz345\pos(1055,340)\frx14\fry6\be0\blur0.6}Wave Motion Gun Control Room
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.84,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\pos(961.5,897)}<Domel>{\fad(450,0)}
